In article <YZVnM4e00Vg6I9q2Zc@andrew.cmu.edu> gk0w+@andrew.cmu.edu (George William Kenny) writes:
>I need to know what are the good things to polymorph into
>when you have a ring of polymorph and polymorph control.

Play a new game of nethack with the option "-X".  (nethack -X)

This puts you in "discover mode".  You will not be able to get on the score
list, but you cannot die and you will have 3 wishes.  Use two of them to wish
for a ring of polymorph and a ring of polymorph control.  You can then try
various types of monsters and figure out for yourself which are best.
